# Binary
agento
agento-dev

# Frontend build output (rebuilt by `make build-frontend`)
# Nothing vite emits is committed: it rewrites index.html with fresh
# content-hashed asset names on every build, so a tracked copy is permanent
# churn and is stale the moment it lands. frontend/dist/favicon.svg IS
# committed so `//go:embed frontend/dist` always has a file to embed and a
# bare `go build` still compiles; release builds (.goreleaser.yaml) and
# `make build` always run `npm run build` first.
frontend/dist/*
!frontend/dist/favicon.svg

# Node modules
frontend/node_modules/

# Go test cache
*.test

